DATA PROVENANCE NOTE — this licence covers the CODE only.

The requirement catalogue in data/ (requirement identifiers, descriptions,
discussions, assessment objectives, point weights, evidence standards and
special-consideration rules) is derived from a publicly released US Government
work: the DCMA DIBCAC "Public 800-171 Self Assessment DB" v1.1 Microsoft Access
database. It is reproduced here unmodified in substance, for interoperability.

This project is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or approved by the Defense
Contract Management Agency, the DIBCAC, the Department of Defense, or any US
Government agency. No government seal, logo, or other branding is used. No
rights are claimed over the underlying government work.
